WEBVTT

00:06:29.839 --> 00:06:31.553
(Laughter)

00:06:31.577 --> 00:06:33.171
"We can't do this now."

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.014
So I asked him,
"Are you breaking up with me?"

00:06:37.038 --> 00:06:40.554
(Laughter)

00:06:40.578 --> 00:06:45.236
And he said, "Look, you signed up
for the blindness, but not this."

00:06:46.477 --> 00:06:49.318
And I answered,
"We don't even know what this is,

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:52.008
but what I do know
is what I can't handle right now

00:06:52.032 --> 00:06:55.052
is a breakup while someone I love
is in intensive care."

00:06:55.076 --> 00:06:57.439
(Laughter)

00:06:57.463 --> 00:07:01.488
So I called on my negotiation skills
and suggested we make a deal.